Sugrīva sees irresistible angry Lakṣmaṇa and trembles --- Sugrīva quits golden seat like Indra banner as women rise like stars --- Sugrīva stands red-eyed folded like great wishing tree --- Lakṣmaṇa rebukes moonlike Sugrīva with Rumā among women --- Lakṣmaṇa praises grateful truthful king and brands false promiser cruelest --- Lakṣmaṇa cites horse cow man lies and Brahmā verse denying ingrate expiation --- Lakṣmaṇa calls Sugrīva ignoble liar ungrateful bids seek Sītā shunning pleasure-snake deceit --- Lakṣmaṇa warns benefit-denier shall see Vālin slain by sharp arrows and bids shun Vālin path
